recommend keep-going choose_pass leads at 924 over forty-three rungs with a fall of 630, and it is the first row of the arc whose function column names two private helpers per rung -- so the lap that takes it must lift both helpers first or discover the answer stops composing, and mend_the_plan behind it is worth reading as the row where the carry queue and the fall queue disagree
